            "detailed_description": "Odd||Even is a math and logic based, integer placement puzzle game created by irritatingFLY studio.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/455940/extras/db7b51e197e5c997f13a7f1be8b82c0f.avif?t=1643784185\" width=620 height=244 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oddeven-game Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>             powerful puzzle generator with natural interface<br></li><li>             feature rich mathematical-software<br></li><li>             full control given to users <br></li><li>             sharp graphics 4k ready<br></li><li>             90 logical selected puzzles<br></li><li>             full rights (once purchased you can use generated puzzles as you like, even for commercial use)</li></ul>",
